@format 1
@id export.reorder-presets
@title Reorder export presets
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Move one custom export preset to a new visible index while leaving native presets fixed.
@section I. UI
@tabs Split, Edit, Convert, Audio, Merge
@flow TB
@related export.add-preset

@alias export = Cadroue.UIShell.PPanels.PExport

[input] Preset drag begins <input>
- Track a custom preset drag and resolve the target index @ export.PExportLiveMove(...)
> move

[move] Apply live order <decision>
- Reject native-preset movement and no-op indices @ export.PExportLiveMove(...)
? "Move is not allowed" > unchanged
? "A new custom index is valid" > result

[result] Preset moved <output>
= Custom preset order matches the visible list.

[unchanged] Order unchanged <output>
= Native and custom preset order remains unchanged.
